WEBVTT

00:00:04.110 --> 00:00:05.040
Hermits.

00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:07.750
They're a sort of meditators.

00:00:07.960 --> 00:00:09.750
And they are really powerful.

00:00:10.050 --> 00:00:16.680
And they use misterious martial arts to live forever.

00:00:17.380 --> 00:00:20.730
Those who want to become almighty are called Shushi.

00:00:20.730 --> 00:00:26.060
This technic was shared to others
training schools, too.

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:29.650
Ouriku joined Reikenha...

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:33.490
and after many years of studying, he turned back home.

00:00:33.990 --> 00:00:35.160
But still...

00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:39.740
His village was foolled by a school called Chishi.

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:43.290
Ouriku defeated their leader.

00:00:43.870 --> 00:00:49.210
And he decided to fight Chishi' school,
to fix things.

00:02:43.210 --> 00:02:47.450
Two days before leaving the village.

00:02:48.870 --> 00:02:53.960
He went to the village of the mountain Reiken Reikenchi.

00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:57.460
Okami-san! Okami-san are you there?!

00:02:57.460 --> 00:02:59.460
What's with all this noise?!

00:02:59.460 --> 00:03:01.800
Don't shout like that!

00:03:04.100 --> 00:03:06.970
I'll open the inn soon...

00:03:07.220 --> 00:03:08.020
Rei-nee!

00:03:08.220 --> 00:03:09.060
A trecut ceva timp.

00:03:09.390 --> 00:03:10.350
Ouriku!

00:03:10.600 --> 00:03:13.270
You didn't leave on your training journey?

00:03:13.270 --> 00:03:14.560
Well...

00:03:14.800 --> 00:03:16.420
A lot of things happened...

00:03:20.570 --> 00:03:24.070
They painted ”that idiot son” on your wall's house?!

00:03:24.410 --> 00:03:26.700
People from village hate you for what you did!

00:03:27.080 --> 00:03:27.950
So funny!

00:03:28.490 --> 00:03:29.150
Anyway...

00:03:29.150 --> 00:03:32.870
I sent one of them to Chishi,
so they never come back.

00:03:32.870 --> 00:03:34.330
This is your plan?

00:03:34.660 --> 00:03:35.340
Yes!

00:03:37.340 --> 00:03:39.340
You think you can handle it?

00:03:39.670 --> 00:03:41.440
Your plan doesn't sound too good.

00:03:41.670 --> 00:03:44.970
Stop complaining about my plan.

00:03:44.970 --> 00:03:46.970
When your inn looks like that.

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:49.850
What?! What you wanna say with this?!

00:03:50.270 --> 00:03:51.140
Alright...

00:03:53.560 --> 00:03:56.110
Okami-san, I bought a pig.

00:03:56.400 --> 00:03:58.410
Put him in storage.

00:03:58.690 --> 00:03:59.480
Fuho!

00:03:59.690 --> 00:04:01.480
What are you doing here?!

00:04:01.820 --> 00:04:04.820
Same for you, what are you doing with that pig?

00:04:07.450 --> 00:04:12.210
I'm a bit slow and I can only use Getetsu Kenpou.

00:04:12.210 --> 00:04:17.220
All requirements from recommendation letter were too dangerous to go just by myself.

00:04:17.540 --> 00:04:21.970
So, you wait for someone that can help you?

00:04:22.260 --> 00:04:23.010
Yes...

00:04:23.930 --> 00:04:25.010
What about Ochi?

00:04:25.300 --> 00:04:27.010
He went to Chushi.

00:04:27.260 --> 00:04:29.510
The journey must be made alone,

00:04:29.810 --> 00:04:32.390
or with a parten.

00:04:32.640 --> 00:04:34.390
Alright, you're lucky.

00:04:34.980 --> 00:04:37.770
I was just thinking that I need help.

00:04:38.150 --> 00:04:39.320
Really?!

00:04:41.220 --> 00:04:42.390
And that's what happened...

00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:46.990
They crossed the line!

00:04:47.070 --> 00:04:49.410
And your village is full of idiots, so...

00:04:49.870 --> 00:04:54.040
Instead of trusting your childhood friend, you trust some strangers?

00:04:54.960 --> 00:04:57.630
And it seems like you're very popular.

00:04:57.920 --> 00:04:59.210
You said something?

00:04:59.630 --> 00:05:01.210
Food was good, wasn't it?

00:05:01.710 --> 00:05:03.630
”It's good for common people to be stupid!”

00:05:04.390 --> 00:05:06.680
”They are easier to handle.”

00:05:06.930 --> 00:05:08.220
What you wanna say with this?

00:05:08.680 --> 00:05:11.140
Honest opinions aren't always good.

00:05:12.600 --> 00:05:14.520
This is what my father used to say, too!

00:05:14.770 --> 00:05:16.890
But I don't undersand what he wants to say...

00:05:17.270 --> 00:05:18.270
I see...

00:05:18.760 --> 00:05:20.750
It's how I espected from a politic man's son.

00:05:21.070 --> 00:05:23.990
If you help me, I'll help you, too.

00:05:24.280 --> 00:05:25.000
Of course!

00:05:25.680 --> 00:05:28.200
I really need someone like you.

00:05:30.100 --> 00:05:32.400
Chishi's school is nothing more than some stupid thing.

00:05:32.830 --> 00:05:35.000
They are weaker than a Renki or a Chikuki.

00:05:35.250 --> 00:05:37.000
Even their leaders are just some Kyotan.

00:05:38.630 --> 00:05:40.420
Kyotan?!

00:05:40.830 --> 00:05:43.540
Well... I forgot the pot on fire...

00:05:43.850 --> 00:05:44.790
Hey!

00:05:45.050 --> 00:05:48.780
Plus, they have no chance againts a Kintan.

00:05:50.160 --> 00:05:55.990
Those who train to become stronger are placed in a specific rank according to their power.

00:05:56.800 --> 00:06:00.060
Dantai and Ouriku are at the rank of Renki.

00:06:00.360 --> 00:06:04.940
Next rank is Chikuki, this rank can extend their life by the age of 200.

00:06:05.620 --> 00:06:08.650
And above them are Kyotan and Kintan.

00:06:09.240 --> 00:06:13.830
And how you can be so confident of yourself?! We talk about Kyotan!

00:06:14.170 --> 00:06:15.710
Don't be so afraid!

00:06:16.160 --> 00:06:19.820
Rei-Nee will help us too, the woman known as 9 tails.

00:06:21.390 --> 00:06:26.320
And because I'm a disciple of
Reikenzan, you can join me.

00:06:26.730 --> 00:06:27.670
Hey, wait a sec!

00:06:28.470 --> 00:06:30.910
By when I became your assistant?

00:06:31.240 --> 00:06:32.180
Rei-Nee...

00:06:32.180 --> 00:06:34.910
Don't be so mean..

00:06:36.100 --> 00:06:36.900
What happened?

00:06:37.220 --> 00:06:39.270
I have to take care of this inn...

00:06:39.630 --> 00:06:40.880
I'm begging you...

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:41.530
No way!

00:06:43.330 --> 00:06:45.230
Bunhou, please go outside.

00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:47.670
What? Oh... ok...

00:06:51.690 --> 00:06:54.910
Master! Please help us with this idiot disciple!

00:06:54.910 --> 00:06:56.480
Eh? I hear nothing!

00:06:56.600 --> 00:06:58.420
Master! I'm begging you, I'm begging you!

00:06:58.420 --> 00:07:00.100
Ew, you're disgusting!

00:07:00.150 --> 00:07:01.500
Master!

00:07:03.420 --> 00:07:06.680
Kotora-chan, it's time for you to sleep, close the light.

00:07:07.200 --> 00:07:08.260
Yes, I understood.

00:07:12.740 --> 00:07:14.300
Kotora-chan, what happened?

00:07:17.880 --> 00:07:20.950
